    - `pnpm --filter @repo/core-data check-types` — clean.
    - `cargo test --features crypto keychain_handle::` — 4/4 pass, including
      the new `wrong_length_zeroizes_caller_buffer` case.
    - `cargo check --features crypto` — clean.
    
